@host = http://localhost:8080

### Customer and latest valid prescription
GET {{host}}/api/customers/lookup?phone=%2B919000000005

### Frames / lenses from Shopify
GET {{host}}/api/products/frames

### Invalid lens validation (RX5007 exceeds 1.56 progressive limits)
POST {{host}}/api/cart/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"+919000000005","location_id":70000002,"staff_id":"S105","rx_id":"RX5007","payment_method":"upi","lines":[{"variant_id":91000003,"pair_ref":"1"},{"variant_id":91000079,"pair_ref":"1"}]}

### Checkout: use a valid 1.60 progressive lens
POST {{host}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"+919000000005","location_id":70000002,"staff_id":"S105","rx_id":"RX5007","payment_method":"upi","channel":"walk_in","lines":[{"variant_id":91000003,"pair_ref":"1"},{"variant_id":91000083,"pair_ref":"1"}]}

### After checkout, replace {orderId} with shopify_order_id
POST {{host}}/api/refunds/99000005/full
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason_code":"CHANGED_MIND"}

### Shopify-backed day-end report
GET {{host}}/api/reports/day-end?locationId=70000002&date=2026-10-25
